Solve, algebraically.
\[
{ }_{n-1} P_{2}=20
\]

\section*{Solution}
\[
\begin{aligned}
\frac{(n-1)!}{(n-1-2)!} & =20 \\
\frac{(n-1)!}{(n-3)!} & =20 \\
\frac{(n-1)(n-2)(n-3)!}{(n-3)!} & =20 \\
n^{2}-3 n+2 & =20 \\
n^{2}-3 n-18 & =0 \\
(n-6)(n+3) & =0 \\
n=6 \quad n> & =-3
\end{aligned}
\]
